  pageNumber: 2
  noteTitle: 'Portier Log 2/4 Afternoon Entry:'
  noteContent: "I reported the power issues to the boss, but he just waved me off.
    \"Routine maintenance,\" my foot! Routine? I saw Kowalski running around the
    corridors like a madman again. Looked like he was searching for something. I
    remember this morning he asked about the key to the Warehouse on the 1st floor,
    but I didn't have it. Later, I saw the cleaner lady with it \u2013 she was heading
    towards the Practice Rooms."
